--TEST--
A property declared `decimal` takes no default, even the number literal a `decimal` parameter default and class constant accept, because a property default has no `decimal` form
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Basket {
    public decimal $rate = 0.19;
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0472]: a property default must be a `decimal` constant
%A
